ora\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tHrishikeshKhandeparkar\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tMikhailKhodak\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tOrestisPlevrakis\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tNikunjSaunshi\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tInternational Conference on Machine Learning\n\t\t\n\t\t\t2019","doi":null,"arxiv_id":null,"title":"A theoretical analysis of contrastive unsupervised representation learning","anchors":[]},{"raw_text":"Self-Supervised Learning from Images with a Joint-Embedding Predictive Architecture\n\t\t\n\t\t\tMahmoudAssran\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tQuentinDuval\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tIshanMisra\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tPiotrBojanowski\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tPascalVincent\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tMichaelGRabbat\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tYannLecun\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tNicolasBallas\n\t\t\n\t\t10.1109/cvpr52729.2023.01499\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t2023 IEEE/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR)\n\t\t\n\t\t\tIEEE\n\t\t\t2023. 2023","doi":"10.1109/cvpr52729.2023.01499","arxiv_id":null,"title":"Self-Supervised Learning from Images with a Joint-Embedding Predictive Architecture","anchors":[{"ref_id":"b3","section_path_id":"2","quote":"Assran et al. (2023)","offset":3753}]},{"raw_text":"AlexeiBaevski\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tWei-NingHsu\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tQiantongXu\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tArunBabu\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tJiataoGu\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tMichaelAuli\n\t\t\n\t\t10.48550/arXiv.2202.03555\n\t\tarXiv:2202.03555\n\t\tGeneral Framework for Self-supervised Learning in Speech, Vision and Language\n\t\t\n\t\t\tFebruary 2022\n\t\t\n\t\n\tarXiv e-prints, art","doi":"10.48550/arXiv.2202.03555","arxiv_id":"2202.03555","title":null,"anchors":[{"ref_id":"b4","section_path_id":"1","quote":"Baevski et al. (2022)","offset":1594}]},{"raw_text":"Contrastive and Non-Contrastive Self-Supervised Learning Recover Global and Local Spectral Embedding Methods\n\t\t\n\t\t\tRandallBalestriero\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tYannLecun\n\t\t\n\t\t10.52202/068431-1934\n\t\tArXiv, abs/2205.11508\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tAdvances in Neural Information Processing Systems 35\n\t\t\n\t\t\t